{%- comment -%}
  AJ Cross-sell — curated attachments to raise order value.

  Deliberately merchant-picked (a collection) rather than algorithmic. On a
  loss-leader model the deal itself makes little or no margin, so the whole
  economics depend on what rides along with it. Shopify's related-product
  recommendations optimise for relevance, which is not the same as optimising
  for margin — an algorithm will happily attach another break-even item.
  Curating the collection lets you put the high-margin things here on purpose.

  Adding is Horizon's own quick-add, so these cards behave exactly like every
  other product card on the site. A second add-to-cart pattern inside a grid
  reads as a bug even when it works. The purpose-built variant picker lives in
  the cart instead — that is the one place worth its own control.

  Excludes whatever product is already in context (the deal, or the PDP being
  viewed), so the strip never suggests the thing already being bought.

  DO NOT reintroduce any "ships together" / "one delivery" copy here. Every
  Collective supplier fulfils its own items, so a cart mixing vendors arrives
  as separate parcels on separate days. Promising a single delivery would be
  false for most multi-item orders. The per-item "Ships from <vendor>" line
  exists to set that expectation before the order, not after it.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% render 'quick-add-styles' %}
{% render 'quick-add-modal-styles' %}

{%- liquid
  assign source = section.settings.collection
  assign limit = section.settings.max_products | plus: 0

  comment
    `closest.product` resolves on a product page; on the homepage it is nil and
    nothing gets excluded, which is correct.
  endcomment
  assign exclude_id = closest.product.id

  comment
    Count what will actually render BEFORE opening any markup, so an empty or
    fully-excluded collection produces no stray heading or padding.
  endcomment
  assign renderable = 0
  for candidate in source.products limit: 50
    unless candidate.id == exclude_id or candidate.available == false
      assign renderable = renderable | plus: 1
    endunless
  endfor
-%}

{%- if renderable > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="aj-cross color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} section spacing-style"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
  >
    <div class="page-width">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="aj-cross__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <p class="aj-cross__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <ul
        class="aj-cross__grid"
        role="list"
        style="--aj-cross-columns: {{ section.settings.columns }};"
      >
        {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
        {%- for item in source.products limit: 50 -%}
          {%- if item.id == exclude_id or item.available == false -%}
            {%- continue -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if shown >= limit -%}
            {%- break -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}

          {%- liquid
            assign item_variant = item.selected_or_first_available_variant
            assign item_on_sale = false
            if item_variant.compare_at_price > item_variant.price
              assign item_on_sale = true
            endif
          -%}

          <li class="aj-cross__item">
            <a class="aj-cross__link" href="{{ item.url }}">
              {%- if item.featured_media -%}
                {{
                  item.featured_media
                  | image_url: width: 600
                  | image_tag:
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 25vw, 45vw',
                    widths: '200, 300, 400, 600',
                    class: 'aj-cross__image',
                    alt: item.featured_media.alt
                }}
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="aj-cross__title">{{ item.title | escape }}</span>
            </a>

            <p class="aj-cross__price">
              <span>{{ item_variant.price | money }}</span>
              {%- if item_on_sale -%}
                <s class="aj-cross__compare">{{ item_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
              {%- endif -%}
            </p>

            {%- if section.settings.show_vendor and item.vendor != blank -%}
              <p class="aj-cross__vendor">Ships from {{ item.vendor | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%}
              Horizon's own quick-add rather than a bespoke button. It adds
              single-variant products in place, and for single-option products
              flips "Choose" to "Add" once a swatch resolves the variant. Using
              it here means these cards behave exactly like every other product
              card on the site — a second add-to-cart pattern in a grid reads
              as a bug even when it works.

              The cart gets the bespoke picker instead, because that is the one
              place worth a purpose-built control.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="aj-cross__action">
              {% render 'quick-add', product: item, section_id: section.id %}
            </div>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="aj-cross aj-cross--empty page-width">
    <p>
      <strong>Cross-sell has nothing to show.</strong>
      Pick a collection in this section's settings. Products that are sold out,
      or that are already being viewed, are skipped automatically.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-cross__heading {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .aj-cross__subheading {
    margin: 0 0 var(--padding-md, 1.5rem);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .aj-cross__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--padding-md, 1.5rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .aj-cross__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--aj-cross-columns, 4), minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .aj-cross__item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .aj-cross__link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .aj-cross__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .aj-cross__title {
    /* Two lines max keeps the cards on a shared baseline; the full title is
       one tap away on the product page. */
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .aj-cross__price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .aj-cross__compare {
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .aj-cross__vendor {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .aj-cross__action {
    /* Pin the action to the bottom so controls line up across cards of
       differing title length. */
    margin-block-start: auto;
  }

  .aj-cross--empty {
    padding-block: var(--padding-xl, 3rem);
    text-align: center;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Cross-sell",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Curated add-ons to attach to an order. Put your higher-margin products in the chosen collection — on a loss-leader deal this is where the margin comes from."
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Add these to your order"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Popular with today's deal.",
      "info": "Do not promise combined shipping here. Each Collective supplier ships its own items, so a mixed cart arrives as separate parcels."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_vendor",
      "label": "Show \"Ships from\" per product",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Sets the expectation that items from different suppliers arrive separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_products",
      "label": "Products shown",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns",
      "label": "Columns on desktop",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 6,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "AJ Cross-sell"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
